   "title": "How to use",
   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Text from Gemma 4 12B\n\n1. Write the request in **prompt**, and the assistant's role and rules in **System prompt**.\n2. Run. The answer appears in **Text**.\n\nTurn **thinking** on for harder questions: the model reasons first, which takes several times longer.\nTo ask about a picture, add a **Load Image** node and connect it to the **image** input; **video** and\n**audio** inputs work the same way. Lower the temperature for lists and tables, raise it for creative text.\nAbout 17 tokens a second on the DGX Spark; the first run loads the model, about 10 seconds."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## Text from Gemma 4 12B\n\n1. Write the request in **prompt**, and the assistant's role and rules in **System prompt**.\n2. Run. The answer appears in **Text**.\n\nTurn **thinking** on for harder questions: the model reasons first, which takes several times longer.\nTo ask about a picture, add a **Load Image** node and connect it to the **image** input; **video** and\n**audio** inputs work the same way. Lower the temperature for lists and tables, raise it for creative text.\nAbout 17 tokens a second on the DGX Spark; the first run loads the model, about 10 seconds."
   },
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
